            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>No matter how you slice it, 2016 was a banner year for biosimilars. Still, the high-stakes marketing, regulatory, and legal combat between originators and biosimilars is a long way from over. So far, the originators have been able to hold their ground and thwart the launch of biosimilars with patent lawsuits.</AbstractText>
